        "Institutional multiplicity: six national commission chairpersons already sit on the NHRC ex officio. Does that argue for merger into an umbrella Human Rights Commission (UPSC 2018), or does specialised advocacy for each vulnerable group justify separate bodies?",
        "The NHRC as complement to, not substitute for, the judiciary — NHRC v. State of Arunachal Pradesh (1996) locus standi, intervention in ongoing proceedings, and the moral weight of an annual report tabled in Parliament",
